    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Pat Toutou (also written "Pat'toutou") is a dog grooming salon at 4 avenue du Général Mangin, in Hyères (Var). Its Facebook page describes it as a "dog grooming salon in Hyères" and gives the address and the phone number 04 94 65 64 26.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon's Facebook page publishes no opening hours, prices or booking arrangements, and the salon does not appear to have a website of its own. The simplest way is to call 04 94 65 64 26 to ask whether the salon will take your dog, when and at what price.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before travelling with your dog, to book an appointment and confirm the hours.</div>

      <h2>To check</h2>
      <p>The most recent content visible on the salon's Facebook page is several years old: current activity, hours and prices should be confirmed by phone.</p>
